@startuml
title MW-04 - Manual Task and Subtask Planning

start
:Open the project planning page;

:Load milestones, tasks and subtasks;

if (Project already has a milestone?) then (No)
  :Prompt to create a milestone first;
  :Create the milestone;
  :Reload the data;
else (Yes)
endif

:Click "New task";
:Enter title, description, task type, milestone and estimated duration;

if (Task type is fixed time?) then (Yes)
  :Enter the fixed start and end time;
  :Auto-create an approved time slot;
else (No)
endif

:Create the task;

:Add the subtasks with their estimated durations;

:Create the subtasks;

:Click the schedule button;
:Choose one subtask or the whole task;

if (One subtask?) then (Yes)
  :Create one time slot for that subtask;
else (Whole task)
  :Split the time by each subtask duration;
  :Create consecutive time slots;
endif

:Display the result on the calendar;

stop
@enduml
